<title>USA: IPO FILING-Signature Eyewear Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Signature Eyewear Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Signature Eyewear Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			SEYE.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9-$11/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    1.8 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.6 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  200,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    5,200,527</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Fechtor, Detwiller &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  270,000 shrs Business: Signature, based in Inglewood, Calif., designs, markets and distributes prescription eyeglass frames primarily under exclusive licenses for Laura Ashley Eyewear, Hart Schaffner &amp; Marx Eyewear and Jean Nate Eyewear and its own Camelot label.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To retire existing bank debt; to launch Eddie Bauer Eyewear, and for working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Oct 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $28,280	    $23,571</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $2,012	     $1,635</p>
